## Conversation
The user asked for a minimal tested DFlash2 implementation and draft pull request. A second read-only training review found that selector normalization could not be pooled correctly across gradient-accumulated microbatches, and it found missing finite-value, layer-bound, and masked D-PACE checks.

## Actions
Made DFlash2 reject draft_accumulation_steps values other than one and changed the example recipe to one. Required a finite positive selector loss weight. Validated target layer IDs against target depth. Added prefix validity to D-PACE recurrence so masked suffix logits cannot change earlier weights. Added boundary and invariance tests. Re-ran the 18 focused tests, the 107-test DFlash/DFlash2/DSpark regression set with the local Mooncake import stub, Ruff, formatting, and diff checks.

